meta {
  name: getManufacturers
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getManufacturers",
    "params": {},
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Retrieve manufacturers

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `page` | integer | no | Page number (1-based) |
  | `limit` | integer | no | Maximum number of results per page (1–1000) |
  | `manufacturer_id` | integer[] (nullable) | no | Filter by internal manufacturer IDs |
  | `external_manufacturer_id` | string[] (nullable) | no | Filter by your system's reference IDs for manufacturers |
  | `include_manufacturer_images` | boolean | no | Include manufacturer images in the response |

  **Example: All manufacturers**

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getManufacturers",
    "params": {},
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "manufacturers": [
      {
        "manufacturer_id": 1,
        "external_manufacturer_id": "ACME",
        "manufacturer_name": "Acme Corp",
        "company_name": "Acme Corporation",
        "company_name_2": "",
        "address": "Industrieweg 1",
        "city": "Utrecht",
        "postal_code": "3542 AD",
        "country_code": "NL",
        "gln": "1234567890123"
      }
    ],
    "page": {
      "number_of_items": 1,
      "items_per_page": 1000,
      "number_of_pages": 1,
      "current_page": 1
    }
  }
  ```
}
